  bx('ye', "<b>Source conflict (SNB):</b> handout 13.2 + slide: passed ICS but <b>not selected</b> (age dispute); Prelims 1999 slide: <b>dismissed</b>. For exam use dismissed (b). In Mains: age + calendar dispute cost him the service, injustice became political fuel."),
  bx('pk', "<b>Prelims 1999 board (exits):</b> Satyendranath Tagore = 1864, first; Banerji = (age) dismissed; <b>R.C. Dutt</b> = retired (Drain Theory); <b>S.C. Bose</b> = resigned (AIR 4, 1st attempt, 6 months prep; slide 1921). <b>Prelims 1996:</b> 1883 National Conference Calcutta (A-4), 1906 Muslim League Dacca (B-3), 1927 All India States People's Conference (C-2), Aug 1932 Communal Award (D-1); answer (c)."),
  bx('bl', "<b>Handout chart extras:</b> Bengal British India Society 1843; East India Association 1866 (London, Naoroji); Bombay Presidency Association 1885 (Pherozeshah Mehta, K.T. Telang, Badruddin Tyabji); Ananda Mohan Bose with SNB; Indian Association originally Bharat Sabha. By 1870 organised INM under WEMC began; 1870s-90s coexistence, WEMC bodies replaced landed ones."),
