  t("<b>Four roles</b>", "<b>14.1 Peasants:</b> Indigo 1859-63, Deccan Riots 1875, Canal Colony 1907", "<b>14.2 Famine relief:</b> Poona Sarvajanik Sabha in 1870s famines; <b>arbitration courts</b> (cheap dispute resolution); 17,000 signs on power of attorney", "<b>14.3 Labour:</b> protested <b>Plantation Labour and Inland Emigration Act 1859</b> (planters could arrest workers who breached contract = serfdom)", t("<b>14.4 Political demands</b>", "Representation in Legislative Councils (<b>Indian Councils Act 1861</b>)", "<b>Separation of powers</b>", "Reduction in <b>Home Charges</b>", "Extend <b>PS 1793</b> to other areas (selfish: landowners gained; Cornwallis 86-93, capitalism)"), "Later: Councils as platforms after <b>Indian Councils Act 1892</b>", w=26),
